			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_567049623178320125">
				Are gamers/people dont like AI?  I do professional SQL development and we use AI for queries now too.    AI is just the way to go these days, more productive.   Though the modelling and business analyst part of the work still requires real humans to think and validate.    <br><br>I have used AI much in the development and it's just a tool like a calculator.  At the end of the day, one's work speaks for itself if it is good or slop, regardless if it was doing 100% by people or not.			</div>
